   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Tools. research: search_research, get_research_note. wall: list_my_wall_crossings, search_deal_documents, get_deal_document. actions: check_restricted_list and list_my_orders (Trade.Read or\nTrade.Execute), place_order (Trade.Execute and the Tools.Execute scope; the governed agent also asks a human to approve). private: get_firm_positions, get_credit_limit. vendor: get_market_quote,\nget_headlines. The private server is not behind the gateway, so it is Wall 2 that refuses.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Tools. research: search_research, get_research_note. wall: list_my_wall_crossings, search_deal_documents, get_deal_document. actions: check_restricted_list and list_my_orders (Trade.Read or\nTrade.Execute), place_order (Trade.Execute and the Tools.Execute scope; the governed agent also asks a human to approve). private: get_firm_positions, get_credit_limit. vendor: get_market_quote,\nget_headlines. The private server is not behind the gateway, so it is Wall 2 that refuses.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
