   "versionNonce": 28381637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What to notice",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "What to notice",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d06_0272",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76.0,
   "y": 1485.0,
   "width": 1315.64,
   "height": 67.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp06_018"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2753986,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 28486366,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- App roles on the user open the gateway and the MCP server (Walls 1 and 2). Group membership opens the data plane (Wall 3). A person needs both to reach data.\n- Orion is open to nobody: no persona holds Wall.Orion and no group has a role on wall-orion. Ian has no app role, so the gateway refuses every tool call he makes.\n- Each server has its own managed identity and no Entra client secret. Four have a federated credential for OBO; the legacy identity is broad on purpose.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- App roles on the user open the gateway and the MCP server (Walls 1 and 2). Group membership opens the data plane (Wall 3). A person needs both to reach data.\n- Orion is open to nobody: no persona holds Wall.Orion and no group has a role on wall-orion. Ian has no app role, so the gateway refuses every tool call he makes.\n- Each server has its own managed identity and no Entra client secret. Four have a federated credential for OBO; the legacy identity is broad on purpose.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
